  "description": "BEMHIO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H54 Cl4 Dy4 N8 O10 2+,2(Cl1 1-),6(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.583-3.827 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.59-112.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)4(μ2-OH)2Cl4]Cl2 (C56H54Cl6Dy4N8O10). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
